<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Steps to reproduce:
</p>
<ul><li>Create a new exterior level. </li>
<li>Click the 'Create an Exportable Area' button. </li>
<li>Click the 'Delete the Exportable Area' button. </li>
<li>Note that the Area Properties dialog remains open, because the default value for Layout Name contains invalid characters.</li>
<li>Closing the Area Properties dialog causes the toolset to crash.</li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Workarounds">Workarounds</span></h2>
<p>Make sure to set a valid Layout Name before deleting the area.
</p>
